    "section": "9.23",
    "heading": "Rest and Recuperation",
    "lineStart": 14026,
    "lineEnd": 14028
  },
  "section": "9.23",
  "rulesText": "If a creature infected with a magical contagion spends 3 days recuperating—engaging in no activities that would interrupt a Long Rest—the creature makes a DC 15 Constitution saving throw at the end of the recuperation period. On a successful save, the creature has Advantage on saving throws to fight off the magical contagion for the next 24 hours."
}
